@startuml ImportExport_Admin
!theme plain

actor "Admin/Staff" as Admin
participant "Frontend\n/src/components/Booking/ExportButton.tsx\n/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n/src/controllers/bookings.controller.ts\n/src/controllers/users.controller.ts" as API
database "MongoDB\n(Collection: bookings, payments, users)" as DB

Admin -> Frontend: Export báo cáo booking/thanh toán/doanh thu
Frontend -> API: Query data với bộ lọc
API -> DB: Lấy dữ liệu báo cáo
DB --> API: Dữ liệu báo cáo
API --> Frontend: Dữ liệu báo cáo
Frontend -> Frontend: Tạo Excel/PDF file
Frontend --> Admin: Download file Excel/PDF

Admin -> Frontend: Export danh sách booking
Frontend -> API: Query bookings với filters
API -> DB: Query bookings
DB --> API: Danh sách bookings
API --> Frontend: Danh sách bookings
Frontend -> Frontend: Tạo Excel file
Frontend --> Admin: Download file Excel

Admin -> Frontend: Export danh sách khách hàng
Frontend -> API: Query users
API -> DB: Query users
DB --> API: Danh sách users
API --> Frontend: Danh sách users
Frontend -> Frontend: Tạo Excel file
Frontend --> Admin: Download file Excel

Admin -> Frontend: Import danh sách khách hàng
Frontend -> API: POST /users/import\n(file Excel)
API -> API: Đọc và validate file Excel
API -> DB: Tạo users từ Excel
DB --> API: Users created
API --> Frontend: Success
Frontend --> Admin: Hiển thị thành công

@enduml

